jxl-rs
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This crate is a wrapper around jxl-rs (https://github.com/libjxl/jxl-rs, the
`jxl` crate), the JPEG XL project's own Rust decoder, which does the decoding
and is used under its BSD-3-Clause licence:

    Copyright (c) the JPEG XL Project Authors. All rights reserved.

The full licence text is in tests/data/LICENSE.jxl-rs. jxl-rs carries a
PATENTS file granting a royalty-free patent licence from Google for its JPEG
XL implementation (https://github.com/libjxl/jxl-rs/blob/main/PATENTS).

The test files in tests/data (*.jxl) are jxl-rs's test data, under the same
BSD-3-Clause licence.
